      "caption": "For a full tutorial, check my YouTube channel in my bio!  With print on demand, you can sell custom products online without purchasing or holding inventory yourself. Here’s how it works: 1. Open your Etsy shop 2. Create a free Printify account and connect it to Etsy 3. Choose a product you want to sell 4. Create and upload your design 5. Customize your title, description, tags and pricing 6. Add eye-catching mockup photos 7. Publish your listing and start selling! When you receive an order, Printify prints, packages and ships the product directly to your customer. 📦 You can find even more beginner-friendly Etsy and print-on-demand tutorials on my YouTube channel! #printondemand #waystomakemoneyonline #onlinebusinessideas #sidehustleforbeginners ",
